{"id":"c01dc45d7752c583","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-los.md","title":"Łoś Theorem","display":"thm-los — Łoś Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-los","aliases":["57-thm-los"],"display":"thm-los — Łoś Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-ultraproduct]]","[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-los"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-los</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-los — Łoś Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba7cca711eed5e6b\" href=\"?note=ba7cca711eed5e6b\" title=\"57-df-ultraproduct\">57-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(I\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i\">\\(i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i\\)</span> 为同签名结构族；全部解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ba7cca711eed5e6b\" href=\"?note=ba7cca711eed5e6b\" title=\"57-df-ultraproduct\">57-df-ultraproduct</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，其自由变量依固定次序恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_n\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq0\">\\(n\\geq0\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_j\\in\\prod_i|\\mathfrak A_i|\">\\(f_j\\in\\prod_i|\\mathfrak A_i|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f_j]=[f_j]_{\\mathcal U}\">\\([f_j]=[f_j]_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>；参数列满足记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U\\models\\varphi[[f_1],\\ldots,[f_n]]\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi[f_1(i),\\ldots,f_n(i)]\\}\\in\\mathcal U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U\\models\\varphi[[f_1],\\ldots,[f_n]]\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi[f_1(i),\\ldots,f_n(i)]\\}\\in\\mathcal U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按公式构造归纳。原子分支由完整超积解释给出；否定用超滤对互补集的二择性；合取用有限交；存在量词正向逐坐标选择见证，反向使用代表元。其余构造子归约或直接归纳。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ba7cca711eed5e6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ba7cca711eed5e6b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"背景 ZFC。$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i$ 为同签名结构族；全部解释见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，其自由变量依固定次序恰为 $x_1,\\ldots,x_n$，$n\\geq0$，见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。$f_j\\in\\prod_i|\\mathfrak A_i|$，$[f_j]=[f_j]_{\\mathcal U}$；参数列满足记号见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"背景 ZFC。$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal 